---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section id="playground" class="demo-section section container" aria-labelledby="demo-title">
  <div class="section-heading"><div><h2 id="demo-title">Make the details<br /><span class="muted-heading">feel alive.</span></h2></div><p>A stationary mask. Moving layers. <br />An interaction you can make your own.</p></div>
  <div class="demo-workbench" data-demo data-motion>
    <div class="demo-stage"><div class="demo-stage-top"><span class="eyebrow">INTERACTION PREVIEW</span><span class="demo-hover-hint">Hover or focus the button</span></div><div class="demo-button-wrap"><button class="demo-button" type="button" aria-describedby="demo-description"><span class="stripe-mask" aria-hidden="true"><span class="demo-stripes"></span></span><span class="demo-button-label">LET’S BUILD</span><Icon name="plus" class="demo-button-dot" /></button></div><div class="demo-stage-bottom"><span class="preview-badge">BROWSER EXAMPLE</span><p id="demo-description">Try movement and 2D tilt. The mask stays fixed.</p></div><p class="sr-only" data-demo-announcement aria-live="polite"></p></div>
    <div class="demo-controls"><div class="control-header"><h3>Dial it in</h3><span class="mono">HOVER</span></div><fieldset data-demo-settings disabled><legend class="sr-only">Example interaction settings</legend><div class="control"><label for="movement">Stripe movement <output id="movement-output" for="movement">48 px</output></label><input id="movement" name="movement" type="range" min="0" max="120" step="4" value="48" aria-describedby="movement-note" /><p id="movement-note">Distance inside the fixed clipping area.</p></div><div class="control"><label for="tilt">Button tilt <output id="tilt-output" for="tilt">−3°</output></label><input id="tilt" name="tilt" type="range" min="-8" max="8" step="1" value="-3" /><p>2D rotation, just like Hover Tilt.</p></div><button class="reset-button" type="button" data-demo-reset>Reset example <Icon name="reset" /></button></fieldset><noscript><p class="notice">Enable JavaScript to adjust the settings. You can still hover or focus the example.</p></noscript><details class="demo-hierarchy" open><summary>Simplified layer hierarchy</summary><ul class="layer-list"><li><Icon name="layers" /> TextButton<ul><li><Icon name="clip" /> StripeMask <small>stationary</small><ul><li><Icon name="square" /> StripeFrame <small>moves on hover</small></li></ul></li><li><Icon name="text" /> Label <small>editable text</small></li></ul></li></ul></details></div>
  </div>
  <p class="demo-footnote">A browser demonstration of the interaction concept. Test generated interactions in Roblox Studio Play mode.</p>
</section>
